('alict_02001', 11, 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 'Which technology uses blockchain to enhance security and transparency in transactions?', '["Internet of Things", "Cloud Computing", "Cryptocurrency", "Augmented Reality", "Artificial Intelligence (AI)"]'::jsonb, 3, 'The correct answer is 3) Cryptocurrency. This is true because cryptocurrencies like Bitcoin and Ethereum use blockchain technology to securely record and verify transactions', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', NULL, 2001, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_02002', 11, 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 'Consider the following benefits received from e-commerce. B-jdKScHfhka ,efnk Can popularize their products globally in fast and efficient way. Tjqkaf.a wdldrfhka yelsh'' B. Remove barriers and no need of a place. ndOl Can select the best with cheap price among the many options. fndfyda wvq foa yel'' Among the above benefits which can a trade institution get?', '["A only. A", "A and B only. A B", "All of the above", "A and C only. A C", "C only. C"]'::jsonb, 2, 'Option Trade institutions can leverage e-commerce to reach a global audience more quickly and effectively than traditional methods. This can help them promote their products to international markets and expand their customer base. this is correct', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', NULL, 2002, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_02003', 11, 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 'What is a bitcoin?', '["A payment gateway in E-commerce", "A decentralized online banking service", "A unit of crypto currency", "A form of electronic stock", "A type of digital payment card"]'::jsonb, 3, 'Bitcoin is a unit of cryptocurrency that operates on a decentralized allowing for peer-to-peer transactions without the need for intermediaries like banks', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', NULL, 2003, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_02004', 11, 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 'On the name given to the websites that are set up to get most of the information that people need in one place', '["E-commerce Site", "Service provider", "E-Distributor", "Web Portal", "E-purchaser"]'::jsonb, 4, 'Option 1: An e-commerce site is primarily focused on buying and selling products or services online. While it may provide some its main function is to facilitate transactions rather than gather diverse information in one place', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', NULL, 2004, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_02005', 11, 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 'Which of the following statements is a disadvantage of e-commerce?', '["Availability of goods and services at lower prices compared to traditional trade", "Being able to run your business from home. ksjfia isgu", "Vulnerability to data", "Development of markets to enable worldwide transactions", "Lower financial costs compared to traditional trading"]'::jsonb, 3, 'Option 1: Availability of goods and services at lower prices is an as it allows businesses to reduce costs and consumers to access cheaper products', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', NULL, 2005, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
