('alict_02047', 1, 'Introduction to ICT & Data/Information', 'Which invention during the Pre -Mechanical Era most fundamentally demonstrated the principle of symbolic data representation as a precursor to modern information systems?', '["The abacus used for arithmetic operations. wxl", "The development of papyrus scrolls in ancient Egypt", "The Antikythera mechanism for astronomical calculation", "Clay tablets from Mesopotamia used for trade records", "The quipu system used by the Incas to store numeric information"]'::jsonb, 5, 'This question targets knowledge of the conceptual roots of information processing. The focus is on how early tools moved from simple calculation or storage to symbolic abstraction and codified the basis of modern data systems. m%Yakh .Kkh olajd Option Incorrect', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Introduction to ICT & Data/Information', NULL, 2047, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_02048', 1, 'Introduction to ICT & Data/Information', 'What type of information system is found in a supermarket?', '["An expert system", "An entrepreneurial system", "A transaction processing system", "A embedded system", "A knowledge management system"]'::jsonb, 3, 'Correct answer: "A transaction processing system". This follows from the standard definitions of data, information, and ICT processing concepts.', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Introduction to ICT & Data/Information', NULL, 2048, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_02049', 1, 'Introduction to ICT & Data/Information', 'Which of the following are computer applications that support the creation and modification of digital content that supports multiple users working in a collaborative environment? iyfhda.S jev nyq iyh iy fjkia iydh : 3) Analysis of the Options', '["TPS (Transaction Processing System", "MIS (Management Information System", "CMS (Content Management System", "rollback()", "execute()"]'::jsonb, 1, 'Correct answer: "TPS (Transaction Processing System". This follows from the standard definitions of data, information, and ICT processing concepts.', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Introduction to ICT & Data/Information', NULL, 2049, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_02050', 1, 'Introduction to ICT & Data/Information', 'Which of the following is a supermarket customer engagement system?', '["Expert system", "Knowledge Management System", "Enterprise Resource Planning System", "Transaction processing system", "Management Information System"]'::jsonb, 4, 'Correct answer: "Transaction processing system". This follows from the standard definitions of data, information, and ICT processing concepts.', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Introduction to ICT & Data/Information', NULL, 2050, 'A/L Past Paper Series')
