('alict_02124', 2, 'Number Systems & Data Representation', 'What is the primary function of a half adder?', '["To perform addition of two binary numbers without a carry-in input. carry-in wdodkhlska", "To perform subtraction of two binary numbers with a carry-out input. carry-out wdodkhla", "To perform addition of two binary numbers with a carry-in input. carry-in wdodkhla", "To perform logical AND operation on two binary numbers", "To perform logical OR operation on two binary numbers"]'::jsonb, 1, 'Option 1: This option is incorrect. A half adder requires a carry in input for any carry generated from previous stages of addition. Without carry it cannot perform an addition with proper carry propagation. /f', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Number Systems & Data Representation', NULL, 2124, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
