('alict_02283', 5, 'Operating Systems & File Management', 'What is the process of reducing the size of a file without losing any data?', '["Lossy compression", "Lossless compression", "Encryption", "Encoding", "Formatting"]'::jsonb, 2, 'Correct answer: "Lossless compression". This reflects standard operating-system concepts (process/file/memory management) as usually taught at A/L.', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Operating Systems & File Management', NULL, 2283, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
