('alict_02288', 5, 'Operating Systems & File Management', 'What is the primary responsibility of the operating system''s process management?', '["Managing the allocation and deallocation of system memory", "Providing a user interface for interacting with the computer system", "Ensuring secure communication between networked devices", "Managing the execution and scheduling of processes", "Optimizing disk storage and file access"]'::jsonb, 4, 'Option 1: According to this it''s false. While memory management is a crucial function of an operating it falls under memory not process management. th Option 2: According to this it''s false', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Operating Systems & File Management', NULL, 2288, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
