('alict_02295', 6, 'Programming Concepts (Python/PHP)', 'What are the values of the following Python expressions?', '["512, 64, 512", "512, 512, 512", "64, 512, 64", "64, 64, 64", "512, 62, 64"]'::jsonb, 1, '• 2**(3**2) This expression is evaluated from right to left due to Python''s operator precedence rules. 3**2 is which equals 9. 2**9 is which equals 512. th 512 g iudk • (2**3)**2 This expression is evaluated from inside parentheses first', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Programming Concepts (Python/PHP)', NULL, 2295, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
