('alict_02312', 6, 'Programming Concepts (Python/PHP)', 'What would be the output of the following Python if i = 12, j = 5 and k = 8? i = 12, j = 5 k = 8 = 12 j = 5 k = 8 ans = i % j + k', '["2", "3", "4", "5", "6 (3) Final calculation"]'::jsonb, 2, 'Correct answer: "3". Trace through the code line by line (variable assignments, loop iterations, and function calls) to confirm this result.', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Programming Concepts (Python/PHP)', NULL, 2312, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_02313', 6, 'Programming Concepts (Python/PHP)', 'What is the output of this Python expression?', '["32", "16", "8", "6", "1"]'::jsonb, 2, 'In operators have different precedence levels that determine the order in which parts of an expression are evaluated. Operations inside parentheses have the highest priority and are performed first', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Programming Concepts (Python/PHP)', NULL, 2313, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_02314', 6, 'Programming Concepts (Python/PHP)', 'What would be the output of the following Python if x = 10, y = 3 and z = 4? x = 10, y = 3 z = 4 = 10 y = 3 z = 4 result = (x', '["10", "11", "12", "9", "8"]'::jsonb, 1, 'x = 10 y = 3 z = 4 result = (x // y = 10 // 3 = 3 (floor division) x % z = 10 % 4 = 2 (remainder) (x // y) * z = 3 * 4 = 12 - (x % z) = 12 - 2 = 10', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Programming Concepts (Python/PHP)', NULL, 2314, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_02315', 6, 'Programming Concepts (Python/PHP)', 'is the output of the above Python o@ Answer : 4) Explanation', '["A only. A", "B only. B", "A and B only. A B", "A and C only. A C", "All of the above"]'::jsonb, 4, 'Correct answer: "A and C only. A C". Trace through the code line by line (variable assignments, loop iterations, and function calls) to confirm this result.', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Programming Concepts (Python/PHP)', NULL, 2315, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_02316', 6, 'Programming Concepts (Python/PHP)', 'What is the data type of the variable ("apple", "banana", "cherry") in Python?', '["List", "Set", "Dictionary", "Tuple", "String"]'::jsonb, 4, 'Correct answer: "Tuple". Trace through the code line by line (variable assignments, loop iterations, and function calls) to confirm this result.', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Programming Concepts (Python/PHP)', NULL, 2316, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
