('alict_02391', 6, 'Programming Concepts (Python/PHP)', 'Consider the following python i in of the following is the correct output?', '["52 end", "52 90 67", "52 90 67 end", "52 90 67 90 end", "52 end 90 end 99 end if i < 90 Inside the there''s an if statement that checks whether the current value of i is less than 90. \u00c6mh i w.h 90 g wvq oehs if the condition i < 90 is the value of i is printed i < 90 fldkafoaish i w.h flf\u00be'' break After printing the value of the break statement immediately exits the meaning no further elements in will be checked or processed. i w.h miq\" break jydu \u00c6mfhka thska woyia ilikq line is outside the loop and will execute after the loop has printing the word ''end'' fuu \u00c6mfhka \u00c6mh wjika miq hk"]'::jsonb, 1, 'Correct answer: "52 end". Trace through the code line by line (variable assignments, loop iterations, and function calls) to confirm this result.', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Programming Concepts (Python/PHP)', NULL, 2391, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
